__pycache__
*.pyc
# a bare name only matches in the context root; the apps' bytecode lives in nested directories
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.env
.env.*
.git
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
htmlcov
.coverage
*.egg-info
venv
.venv
node_modules

# Real data and generated files never go into an image.
# Uploaded workbooks (davinci imports are saved under media/) and spreadsheets or CSV exports anywhere in the
# tree (*.xls* also covers xlsx, xlsm, xlsb):
media/
**/*.xls*
**/*.csv
# the match is case sensitive: keep REPORT.XLS, Export.Csv and the like out as well
**/*.[xX][lL][sS]*
**/*.[cC][sS][vV]
# collectstatic output (the Dockerfile rebuilds it):
staticfiles/
# the retired Streamlit app and the tests that live outside the apps:
dashboard/
tests/
